                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is a good LTV:CAC ratio?</h3>
                                        <p>3:1 minimum, 4:1 healthy, 5:1+ category-leading. Below 3:1 unsustainable long-term.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the single biggest LTV lever?</h3>
